    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "מאת",
      "rationale": "Em i tok bilong 'long' wantaim ⟨את⟩ — mi holim ⟨את⟩ long en, olsem Lo i tok."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na yu, pikinini man: ol pikinini bilong ol manmeri bilong yu, ol i tok tok long yu klostu long ol banis, na long ol dua bilong ol haus; na wanpela i tok wantaim ⟨את⟩ narapela, man wantaim ⟨את⟩ brata bilong en, se: Kam, na harim wanem tok i kamap ausait long ⟨את⟩ Yahwe.",
